# promise: #278
# A settings.json from a newer Cra, with an archive threshold this one doesn't know, loads with the
# longest threshold this Cra has and the rest of the file as written. Until #278 the whole file was
# set aside as .corrupt (a fault) and the defaults archived every Today tab unused for 12 hours.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "autoArchive": "aValueFromTheFuture", "searchEngine": "aSearchEngineFromTheFuture"}
wait 2
reject-log unreadable, set aside as \.corrupt
# What it saved (180 days as "thirtyDays" plus "autoArchiveDays", which Cra 0.1.36 reads) loads again.
relaunch
wait 2
reject-log unreadable, set aside as \.corrupt
